ip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"The bright light on its tail can be seen far away. It has been treasured since ancient times as a beacon."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le bout de sa queue brille avec intensité. Jadis, on s’en servait pour envoyer des signaux."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le bout de sa queue brille avec intensité. Jadis, on s’en servait pour envoyer des signaux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The tip of its tail shines brightly. In the olden days, people sent signals using the tail’s light."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The tip of its tail shines so brightly it can be used to send sea-navigation beacons to distant foreign shores."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The tip of its tail shines so brightly it can be used to send sea-navigation beacons to distant foreign shores."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Le bout de sa queue brille si fort qu’il peut être vu de très loin. Il sert de balise aux gens."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"La punta de su cola reluce brillantemente y puede ser vista desde lejos. Es usado como faro."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The tail’s tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"尻尾の先が 光り輝く。 光は はるか 遠くまで 届き 迷った者の 道標となる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Le bout de sa queue brille si fort qu’il peut être vu de très loin. Il sert de balise aux gens."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"La punta de su cola reluce brillantemente y puede ser vista desde lejos. Es usado como faro."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The tail’s tip shines brightly and can be seen from far away. It acts as a beacon for lost people."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾の 先が 光り輝く。 光は はるか 遠くまで 届き 迷った者の 道標となる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Pharamp est si lumineux qu’on peut le voir de l’espace. Jadis, les gens utilisaient la lumière de ce Pokémon pour communiquer et s’envoyer des signaux à grande distance."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ampharos desprende tanta luz que es posible verle hasta desde el espacio. Antes, la gente usaba su luz como sistema de comunicación para enviarse señales."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ampharos gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used the light of this Pokémon to send signals back and forth with others far away."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"デンリュウの 灯りは 宇宙からも 見える。 昔の 人は デンリュウの 灯りを 使い 遠くの 仲間と 合図を 送りあっていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Pharamp est si lumineux qu’on peut le voir de l’espace. Jadis, les gens utilisaient la lumière de ce Pokémon pour communiquer et s’envoyer des signaux à grande distance."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ampharos desprende tanta luz que es posible verle hasta desde el espacio. Antes, la gente usaba su luz como sistema de comunicación para enviarse señales."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ampharos gives off so much light that it can be seen even from space. People in the old days used the light of this Pokémon to send signals back and forth with others far away."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"デンリュウの 灯りは 宇宙からも 見える。 昔の 人は デンリュウの 灯りを 使い 遠くの 仲間と 合図を 送りあっていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La lumière de sa queue est si vive qu’on peut la voir depuis l’espace. En général, il l’éteint donc pour éviter de se faire repérer."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"La luz que emite su cola puede verse desde el espacio, delatando su presencia a todos. Es por eso que normalmente la mantiene apagada."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"The light from its tail can be seen from space. This is why you can always tell exactly where it is, which is why it usually keeps the light off."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"シッポの 光は 宇宙まで 届くので どこにいるか まるわかり。 だから 普段は 消している。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Sa queue brille d’une lumière éclatante. Depuis des temps très anciens, il est vénéré comme le guide des marins."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Su cola emite un brillo claro e intenso. Se lo venera desde tiempos remotos como guía de los marineros."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its tail shines bright and strong. It has been prized since long ago as a beacon for sailors."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"シッポは 強く 明るく 輝く。 船乗りたちの 道しるべ として 昔から 大切に されてきた。"}],"varieties":[{"id":181,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[3,"level-up",30],[3,"machine",0],[4,"level-up",30],[4,"machine",0],[5,"level-up",30],[6,"level-up",30],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",30],[8,"level-up",30],[9,"level-up",30],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"level-up",30],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",30],[12,"level-up",30],[13,"level-up",30],[14,"level-up",30],[14,"tutor",0],[15,"level-up",30],[16,"level-up",30],[16,"tutor",0],[17,"level-up",0],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",0],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"tutor",0],[23,"level-up",0],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"mega-k